  "sourceText": "Vitamin C Powerhouse Drink\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 lemon\n1 orange\ngrapefruit\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Peel the fruits, quarter them and remove seeds. Liquify in blender a few pieces at a time, along with just a bit of peel. Mix with equal parts of either hot or cold spring water.",
